rt text says it is not. `verified:` and `Re-verification: No, initial verification` (line 26) were also not\nupdated, though the status flipped after UAT.\n**Fix:** Re-run verification, or update body line 25, lines 90-102, `human_verification`, and add a re-verification note\npointing at d230b4e and the UAT resolution.\n\n### WR-04: VERIFICATION `verified` timestamp is later than every commit in the repository\n\n**File:** `.planning/phases/01-retry-budget/01-VERIFICATION.md:3,24,111`\n**Issue:** `verified: 2026-11-02T12:10:00Z`. File was first committed in 8ddef7a (2026-11-02T06:46:37-05:00 = 11:46:37Z)\nand last edited in f633cf0 (07:00:43-05:00 = 12:00:43Z). The stamp is 9 min 17 s after HEAD and 23 min after the first\ncommit. The earlier review reported this (WR-05) and it is not fixed; f633cf0 touched the file and left it. The\nUAT, whose `source` is this file, started at 11:46:36Z, before the verification claims to have run.\n**Fix:** Write the stamp from `date -u +%FT%TZ` at generation time.\n\n### WR-05: Review disposition and VERIFICATION cite 4 open findings; the current review has 17\n\n**File:** `.planning/phases/01-retry-budget/01-REVIEW-DISPOSITION.md:6-23`, `01-VERIFICATION.md:104`, `01-REVIEW.md:13-15`\n**Issue:** Disposition (`review: 01-REVIEW.md`) lists WR-01, WR-02, IN-01, IN-02 and `open: 4, total: 4`, recorded\n2026-11-02T11:44:42Z. `01-REVIEW.md` (11:52:35Z, commit 8a03c38) now has WR-01..WR-10 and IN-01..IN-07 (17 findings;\nI counted the headings, matching its frontmatter 10/7/17). 13 findings (WR-03..WR-10, IN-03..IN-07) have no disposition\nrow. VERIFICATION line 104, \"4 items, all `open`\", is therefore also stale. Separately, IDs WR-01/WR-02/IN-01/IN-02 were\nreused by the rewrite for the same findings (titles match), so those four rows are fine.\n**Fix:** Re-run the disposition gate against the current review and update VERIFICATION line 104.\n\n### WR-06: 01-REVIEW.md statements about gate state and UAT are false at HEAD\n\n**File:*